3|時々|ときどき|sometimes|adverb-expression|時々、映画を見ます。|I sometimes watch movies.|時々、カフェで勉強します。|I sometimes study at a cafe.
3|よく|よく|often; much|adverb-expression|よく音楽を聞きます。|I often listen to music.|週末はよく図書館に行きます。|I often go to the library on weekends.
3|そうですね|そうですね|That's right.; Let me see.|adverb-expression|そうですね、七時ごろ行きます。|Let me see. I'll go at about seven.|そうですね、この本はいいですね。|That's right. This book is good, isn't it?
3|でも|でも|but|adverb-expression|今日は勉強します、でも明日はテニスをします。|I'll study today. But I'll play tennis tomorrow.|コーヒーは飲みます、でもお酒は飲みません。|I drink coffee. But I don't drink alcohol.
